  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional strengthening of the CADEC National Office</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced  skills and competencies of the Diocesan CADECs, as institutions, to improve on their response to the needs of the poor and vulnerable communities they serve in their respective Dioceses by September 2011 through:
Capacity Building training and  workshops on various issues, exchange visits, quarterly meetings,
monitoring visits, networking, documentation and shared learning and advisory services to the Bishops&#x2019; Conference</narrative>
  </description>
